    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100009" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκ-τρέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rear up along with</i> or <i>together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γεννηθὲν κοινῇ μετ᾽ ἐκείνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					209c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τοὺς παῖδας</span>
			<i>assist in bringing</i> them <i>up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mx.</u>
				249a
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Brut.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>grow up with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκτραφεὶς ἐμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					709
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				32
			</span></i>.</div>
